<li>&lt;a href="1943"&gt;1943&lt;/a&gt; – Perang Dunia II: Dina &lt;a href="Operasi%20Vengeance"&gt;Operasi Vengeance&lt;/a&gt;, Admiral Isoroku Yamamoto nemasing pati nalika pasawatna ditémbak murag ku pasawat tempur AS di saluhureun &lt;a href="Pulo%20Bougainville"&gt;Pulo Bougainville&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1945"&gt;1945&lt;/a&gt; – Leuwih ti 1.000 pasawat pangebom nyerang pulo leutik &lt;a href="Heligoland"&gt;Heligoland&lt;/a&gt; di Jérman.</li>
