<li>2013 – Dua &lt;a href="plan%C3%A9t"&gt;planét&lt;/a&gt; nu siga &lt;a href="bumi"&gt;bumi&lt;/a&gt; katimu ngorbit ka &lt;a href="b%C3%A9ntang%20Kepler-62"&gt;béntang Kepler-62&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="2018"&gt;2018&lt;/a&gt; – King Mswati III ti &lt;a href="Swaziland"&gt;Swaziland&lt;/a&gt; ngabéwarakeun yén nagarana bakal ganti ngaran jadi &lt;a href="Eswatini"&gt;Eswatini&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
