<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="303"&gt;303&lt;/a&gt; – Universitas Sapienza Roma dirasmikeun ku Paus Bonface VIII.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1534"&gt;1534&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Jacques%20Cartier"&gt;Jacques Cartier&lt;/a&gt; ngamimitian lalampahanna nuju ka naon anu kiwari nelah ku Basisir Kanada, Newfoundland jeung Labrador.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1535"&gt;1535&lt;/a&gt; – Fenomena &lt;a href="anjing%20panon%20po%C3%A9"&gt;anjing panon poé&lt;/a&gt; kasawang di &lt;a href="Stockholm"&gt;Stockholm&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1653"&gt;1653&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Oliver%20Cromwell"&gt;Oliver Cromwell&lt;/a&gt; ngabubarkeun Parlemén Rump.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1657"&gt;1657&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Admiral%20Robert%20Blake"&gt;Admiral Robert Blake&lt;/a&gt; ngancurkeun kapal perang perak Spanyol dina Patempuran Santa Cruz de Tenerife.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1775"&gt;1775&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="Perang%20R%C3%A9volusi%20Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Perang Révolusi Amérika&lt;/a&gt;: &lt;a href="Pangepungan%20Boston"&gt;Pangepungan Boston&lt;/a&gt; dimimitian, nuluykeun &lt;a href="Patempuran%20Lexington%20jeung%20Concord"&gt;Patempuran Lexington jeung Concord&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1792"&gt;1792&lt;/a&gt; – Perancis nyatakeun perang ka “Raja Hongaria jeung Bohemia”, awal tina &lt;a href="Perang%20R%C3%A9volusi%20Perancis"&gt;Perang Révolusi Perancis&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1800"&gt;1800&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="R%C3%A9publik%20Septinsular"&gt;Républik Septinsular&lt;/a&gt; diadegkeun.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="1809"&gt;1809&lt;/a&gt; – Dua korps tentara Austria di Bavaria diéléhkeun ku Tentara Karajaan Perancis Kahiji nu dipingpin ku &lt;a href="Napoleon%20Bonaparte"&gt;Napoléon&lt;/a&gt; dina &lt;a href="Patempuran%20Abensberg"&gt;Patempuran Abensberg&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
