<li>&lt;a href="1865"&gt;1865&lt;/a&gt; – Astronom &lt;a href="Angelo%20Secchi"&gt;Angelo Secchi&lt;/a&gt; ngébréhkeun &lt;a href="cakram%20Secchi"&gt;cakram Secchi&lt;/a&gt;, keur ngukur tingkat kabersihan cai.</li>
